{"words": [{"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "يُرِيدُ", "translation": "wishes"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "يَتُوبَ", "translation": "accept repentance"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "from you"}, {"text": "وَيُرِيدُ", "translation": "but wish"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "يَتَّبِعُونَ", "translation": "follow"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّهَوَٰتِ", "translation": "the passions"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تَمِيلُوا۟", "translation": "you deviate "}, {"text": "مَيْلًا", "translation": "(into) a deviation"}, {"text": "عَظِيمًۭا", "translation": "great"}], "sahih": "Allāh wants to accept your repentance, but those who follow [their] passions want you to digress [into] a great deviation."}